<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>로그인 | Busan Play</title>
    {{> login/style}}
</head>
<body>
{{> layout/header}}
<main class="auth-page">
    <div class="auth-layout">
        <section class="auth-intro" aria-labelledby="welcome-title">
            <span class="auth-badge">BUSAN PLAY · WELCOME BACK</span>
            <h1 id="welcome-title">부산의 즐거움,<br>다시 이어가세요.</h1>
            <p>가보고 싶은 행사부터 새로운 만남까지.<br>로그인하고 나만의 부산을 만나보세요.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="auth-card" aria-labelledby="form-title">
            <h2 id="form-title">로그인</h2>
            <p class="auth-subtitle">가입하신 이메일로 로그인해주세요.</p>
            <form action="/login" method="post">
                <div class="auth-field">
                    <label for="email">이메일</label>
                    <input id="email" name="email" type="text" inputmode="email" autocomplete="username" maxlength="254" placeholder="name@example.com" required>
                </div>
                <div class="auth-field">
                    <label for="password">비밀번호</label>
                    <input id="password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="비밀번호를 입력해주세요" required>
                </div>
                <button class="auth-button auth-submit" type="submit">로그인</button>
            </form>
            <p class="auth-links">아직 회원이 아니신가요? <a href="/signup">회원가입</a></p>
        </section>
    </div>
</main>
{{> layout/footer}}
</body>
</html>
